  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "aiwritex-html-2b6fbb7e503b",
  "type": "html-template",
  "original": {
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>CrewAI 排版配置指南</title>\n</head>\n\n<body\n  style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%); color: #333; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 16px; min-height: 100vh;\">\n\n  <!-- 顶部标题区域 -->\n  <section\n    style=\"padding: 0; background-color: #246EB9; color: white; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px; border-radius: 0 0 30px 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px;\">CrewAI 排版配置指南</h1>\n    <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.9; font-weight: 300;\">专业智能代理框架的最佳实践</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 引言卡片 -->\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 0 0 25px; padding: 25px; background-color: white; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); overflow: hidden;\">\n    <section style=\"float: right; width: 80px; height: 80px; margin: -25px -25px 0 0;\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"0\" r=\"80\" fill=\"#F5F7FA\" />\n        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"0\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#E4ECF7\" />\n        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"0\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#D4E0F4\" />\n      </svg>\n    </section>\n    <section style=\"margin-right: 60px;\">\n      <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #246EB9;\">为什么排版配置如此重要？</h2>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">在使用 CrewAI\n        构建智能代理系统时，排版配置的位置直接影响代码的可读性和可维护性。明智的配置安排可以使代码逻辑更清晰，同时提高开发效率。</p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 核心问题卡片 -->\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 0 0 25px; padding: 25px; background-color: #F8FAFC; border-radius: 18px; border-left: 5px solid #246EB9; box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #246EB9;\">核心问题</h2>\n    <section style=\"padding: 15px; background-color: #EDF2F7; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 500; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2D3748;\">\n        使用CrewAI时，排版要求是放在agents配置中好，还是放在对应的task配置中好？</p>\n    </section>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">这是一个关于代码组织和设计模式的问题，关系到系统架构的整体清晰度和维护性。我们需要分析两种方式的优缺点。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 选项对比 -->\n  <section style=\"margin: 0 0 25px; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px;\">\n\n    <!-- 选项1 -->\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 20px; background-color: white; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;\">\n      <h3\n        style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #246EB9; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; background-color: #246EB9; color: white; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 15px;\">1</span>\n        在 Agents 配置中设置排版要求\n      </h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 38px;\">\n        将排版要求放在agent的配置中，意味着这些要求将成为代理的固有特性。</p>\n\n      <section style=\"margin-top: 15px; padding-left: 38px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;\">优点：</p>\n        <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: none;\">\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 15px;\">\n            <span\n              style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background-color: #246EB9; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 9px;\"></span>\n            所有任务自动继承相同的排版风格\n          </li>\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 15px;\">\n            <span\n              style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background-color: #246EB9; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 9px;\"></span>\n            代码更简洁，避免在每个任务中重复定义\n          </li>\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0; padding-left: 15px;\">\n            <span\n              style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background-color: #246EB9; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 9px;\"></span>\n            确保代理的输出风格一致性\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;\">缺点：</p>\n        <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: none;\">\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 15px;\">\n            <span\n              style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background-color: #EB4C60; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 9px;\"></span>\n            降低灵活性，所有任务被迫使用相同格式\n          </li>\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0; padding-left: 15px;\">\n            <span\n              style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background-color: #EB4C60; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 9px;\"></span>\n            可能与特定任务的专业需求冲突\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 选项2 -->\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 20px; background-color: white; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;\">\n      <h3\n        style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #246EB9; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; background-color: #246EB9; color: white; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 15px;\">2</span>\n        在 Task 配置中设置排版要求\n      </h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 38px;\">\n        将排版要求放在具体任务的配置中，使每个任务可以有独特的格式需求。</p>\n\n      <section style=\"margin-top: 15px; padding-left: 38px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;\">优点：</p>\n        <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: none;\">\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 15px;\">\n            <span\n              style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background-color: #246EB9; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 9px;\"></span>\n            高度灵活，可根据任务需求定制格式\n          </li>\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 15px;\">\n            <span\n              style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background-color: #246EB9; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 9px;\"></span>\n            符合关注点分离原则，任务与格式耦合\n          </li>\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0; padding-left: 15px;\">\n            <span\n              style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background-color: #246EB9; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 9px;\"></span>\n            可以为不同类型的输出优化格式\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;\">缺点：</p>\n        <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: none;\">\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 15px;\">\n            <span\n              style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background-color: #EB4C60; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 9px;\"></span>\n            代码冗余，相同格式要求需重复定义\n          </li>\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0; padding-left: 15px;\">\n            <span\n              style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background-color: #EB4C60; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 9px;\"></span>\n            可能导致系统输出风格不一致\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 最佳实践建议 -->\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 0 0 25px; padding: 25px; background-color: white; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #246EB9;\">最佳实践建议</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 500; color: #2D3748;\">结合两种方法，采用<span\n        style=\"color: #246EB9; border-bottom: 2px solid #246EB9; padding-bottom: 2px;\">层级继承模式</span>获得最佳效果：</p>\n\n    <section style=\"padding: 20px; background-color: #F7FAFC; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #2D3748;\">1. 基础排版风格放在 Agents 配置中</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">在agent配置中定义通用的排版要求，如字体、基本布局风格和品牌标识等。这确保了所有输出的基本一致性。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"padding: 20px; background-color: #F7FAFC; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #2D3748;\">2. 特定格式要求放在 Tasks 配置中</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">在任务配置中添加针对该任务独特的排版要求，如特定内容的展示方式、专业术语的格式等，这些会覆盖或补充基础样式。\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"padding: 20px; background-color: #F7FAFC; border-radius: 12px;\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #2D3748;\">3. 使用配置继承简化代码</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">创建一个格式配置库，允许在不同级别引用和扩展配置，避免代码重复，同时保持灵活性和一致性。</p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 代码示例 -->\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 0 0 25px; padding: 25px; background-color: #1A202C; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: white;\">代码示例</h2>\n    <section style=\"background-color: #2D3748; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; overflow-x: auto;\">\n      <section\n        style=\"float: right; background-color: #246EB9; color: white; font-size: 12px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n        Python</section>\n      <pre\n        style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Menlo', 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #E2E8F0; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><code># Agent 配置中的基础排版设置\nformatting_base = \"\"\"\n- 使用中文回答\n- 保持简洁清晰的格式\n- 段落间留有适当空白\n\"\"\"\n\n# 创建代理\nresearcher = Agent(\n    role=\"研究员\",\n    goal=\"提供深入研究和分析\",\n    backstory=\"专业研究人员，擅长数据分析\",\n    formatting=formatting_base,  # 基础排版应用于所有任务\n)\n\n# Task 配置中的特定排版需求\nreport_task = Task(\n    description=\"分析市场趋势并生成报告\",\n    agent=researcher,\n    # 特定任务的额外排版要求\n    formatting=\"\"\"\n    - 使用表格展示核心数据\n    - 每个部分使用明确的标题\n    - 关键结论用粗体标记\n    \"\"\"\n)</code></pre>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 结论与建议 -->\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 0 0 25px; padding: 25px; background-color: white; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #246EB9;\">结论</h2>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #246EB9;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 500;\">\n        在实际项目中，应根据团队规模和项目复杂度选择适合的配置方案。核心原则是<span style=\"color: #246EB9;\">平衡一致性与灵活性</span>。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">对于大多数中等规模的 CrewAI 项目，建议采用分层配置方法：</p>\n\n    <ol style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 25px;\">\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n        在代理配置中定义<strong style=\"color: #246EB9;\">通用格式标准</strong>，确保品牌一致性\n      </li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n        在任务配置中添加<strong style=\"color: #246EB9;\">特定格式需求</strong>，满足专业展示要求\n      </li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n        创建<strong style=\"color: #246EB9;\">可重用的格式模板库</strong>，促进代码整洁与维护性\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 互动元素 -->\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 0 0 25px; padding: 20px; background-color: #F0F4F8; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); text-align: center;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #246EB9;\">你的 CrewAI 项目是什么规模？</h3>\n    <section style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;\">\n      <section\n        style=\"padding: 12px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #246EB9 0%, #4299E1 100%); color: white; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; flex: 1; min-width: 100px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); opacity: 0.95;\">\n        <span style=\"margin-right: 8px;\">📈</span>小型项目\n      </section>\n      <section\n        style=\"padding: 12px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #246EB9 0%, #4299E1 100%); color: white; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; flex: 1; min-width: 100px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); opacity: 0.95;\">\n        <span style=\"margin-right: 8px;\">🏢</span>中型项目\n      </section>\n      <section\n        style=\"padding: 12px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #246EB9 0%, #4299E1 100%); color: white; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; flex: 1; min-width: 100px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); opacity: 0.95;\">\n        <span style=\"margin-right: 8px;\">🌐</span>大型企业项目\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 0 0 25px; padding: 25px; background-color: white; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #246EB9;\">CrewAI 排版配置模式</h2>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 400px;\">\n      <!-- 背景 -->\n      <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#F8FAFC\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"10\" />\n\n      <!-- Agent 配置区域 -->\n      <rect x=\"30\" y=\"30\" width=\"340\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#246EB9\" rx=\"8\" ry=\"8\" opacity=\"0.9\" />\n      <text x=\"200\" y=\"56\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Agent 配置 - 基础排版风格</text>\n      <text x=\"200\" y=\"76\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">通用格式、品牌标识、一致性要求</text>\n\n      <!-- 箭头 -->\n      <path d=\"M200,90 L200,120\" stroke=\"#2D3748\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" />\n      <polygon points=\"200,130 195,120 205,120\" fill=\"#2D3748\" />\n\n      <!-- Task 配置区域 -->\n      <rect x=\"100\" y=\"130\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#4299E1\" rx=\"8\" ry=\"8\" opacity=\"0.9\" />\n      <text x=\"200\" y=\"153\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Task 配置 - 特定需求</text>\n      <text x=\"200\" y=\"171\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">专业展示、特定格式</text>\n\n      <!-- 点缀圆圈 -->\n      <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"160\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#246EB9\" opacity=\"0.2\" />\n      <circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"140\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#246EB9\" opacity=\"0.2\" />\n      <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"170\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#246EB9\" opacity=\"0.2\" />\n      <circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"120\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#246EB9\" opacity=\"0.2\" />\n    </svg>\n  </section>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"padding: 24px; color: #292b2e; background-color: #fff\"><h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px\">把生活里的小事，慢慢做好</h1><section><p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300\">生活里有许多值得记录的瞬间。早上推开窗，阳光落在桌面上，新的一天从一杯温水开始。</p><h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #246EB9\">留一点时间给自己</h2><p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300\">每天给自己留出一小段安静的时间，读几页书，或者去楼下走一走。<strong style=\"color: #246EB9\">从一件具体的小事开始</strong>，让改变自然发生。</p><blockquote><p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300\">认真对待每一个平常的日子。</p></blockquote><h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #246EB9\">让行动变得简单</h2><ul style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: none\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 15px\">选一件今天可以完成的事</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 15px\">留意自己的真实感受</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 15px\">给下一次尝试留出余地</li></ul><table><thead><tr><th>时段</th><th>安排</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>早晨</td><td>散步和阅读</td></tr><tr><td>傍晚</td><td>回顾一天</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300\">生活不会因为一次决定立刻改变，但持续的行动会慢慢留下痕迹。</p></section></section>",
  "layoutPrompt": "[cw-imported-style:{\"root\":\"padding:24px;color:#292b2e;background-color:#fff\",\"elements\":{\"h1\":\"margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px\",\"h2\":\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #246EB9\",\"h3\":\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #246EB9; display: flex\",\"p\":\"margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300\",\"strong\":\"color: #246EB9\",\"ul\":\"margin: 0 0 15px; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: none\",\"ol\":\"margin: 0; padding-left: 25px\",\"li\":\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 15px\",\"pre\":\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Menlo', 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #E2E8F0; white-space: pre-wrap\",\"span\":\"display: inline-flex; width: 28px; height: 28px; background-color: #246EB9; color: white; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 15px\"}}]",
